  candidate verifier: compute orders, normality defects, rational image properties, and traces
codex
I’ll start with Step 0 and inspect the full paper plus the repository harness before deciding whether this supports an honest Track A or Track B family. The key triage point is whether checking or finding the finite-field witness reduces to an efficient standard computation in the paper’s parameter regime.
