\begin{theorem}{\label{seive}}
    Assume the notations and conditions in Lemma \ref{l1pi-l1}. Let $\delta = 1- \sum_{i=1}^{u} \frac{1}{p_i} -\sum_{i=1}^{v} \frac{1}{q_i} - \sum_{i=1}^{s} \frac{1}{q^{deg(P_i)}} - \sum_{i=1}^{t} \frac{1}{q^{deg(Q_i)}} >0 $ and $\Delta = \frac{u+v+s+t-1}{\delta} +2$. If 
