$=a$ and $\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathbb{F}_{q^n}/\mathbb{F}_q}(\epsilon^{-1})=b$, for any prescribed $a,b \in \mathbb{F}_{q}$, where $F\in \Lambda_{q^n}(10,11)$.
